            "text_23": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We believe that brilliance should be accessible. At Aura, we curate both natural, precious, semi-precious and laboratory-grown gemstones, expanding the entry point for fine jewelry without sacrificing the aesthetic or technical standards of our master craftsmen. This approach allows us to deliver high-quality assets across a broader financial spectrum.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "normal",
